    [31m/* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────[39m
    [31m   05 — WORKING WITH JG  (the Americas map — ported from sandbox #mapx)[39m
    [31m   Centered + contained, no scroll-hijack: all three cards visible,[39m
    [31m   parked over open ocean with connector arcs; cards-only parallax.[39m
    [31m   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */[39m
    [31m#mapx {[39m
    [31m  background: #202124;[39m
